QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Breakfast & Brunch, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"5fCpIolPWznGdz3D6hjrvg","review_id":"b3cjRXXv9T4P7PGZsFvi4g","date":"2014-10-10T15:58:22","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.939370334148407,"text_excerpt":"I live right around the corner and have been wanting to try this place for a while now because I've heard grood things. Its very small when you walk in with just a few tables inside and a couple outside. All the coffee cups are different which makes you feel right at home. I got the breakfast burrito with chorizo which was very good! My friend got the sausage biscuit and cheese sandwich with grits which was a little small but pretty good. They also have biscuits, pastries, muffins, and sweets in a glass case at the front where you order which all looked delicious! The service was very friendly and the food came out quick and hot! Also you can see them make your food so you know its clean!..."},{"business_id":"5fCpIolPWznGdz3D6hjrvg","review_id":"oacD431oYsZek-ZYs1E7Ew","date":"2014-06-30T12:57:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9389331340789795,"text_excerpt":"This is a great little breakfast place. I had breakfast here this morning. I had the 1 egg \"box breakfast,\" which came with one egg, bacon, a biscuit, and a choice of sides (I went with grits). The grits were amazing! Seriously. They were the best grits I've had, probably. The biscuit was good, too, as was the blueberry jam that came with it. Seriously. I think only Besh's grits compare. It is tucked away in an interesting neighborhood and very small. You place your order and pay at the counter but a very nice employee will bring it to you. I am big on breakfast and, now that I am on the southshore, Wakin' Bakin' will definitely be on my rotation."},{"business_id":"5fCpIolPWznGdz3D6hjrvg","review_id":"p2Csem7gsE_KR85LM2Cqcg","date":"2014-06-15T14:03:03","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9384440183639526,"text_excerpt":"Try this place for a quick and filling breakfast. Employees are warm and friendly. Food is hearty, buttery, and cheesy. They gave me a huge cup for my coffee, which was certainly appreciated. Pancrepes were tasty. Small inside, but ToGo containers were nice, which I appreciated."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"5fCpIolPWznGdz3D6hjrvg","photo_id":"rUK3hYJsWSg8O00fs0mGCw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/rUK3hYJsWSg8O00fs0mGCw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9201486110687256},{"business_id":"5fCpIolPWznGdz3D6hjrvg","photo_id":"-RQeUQ6oWjA145ZrZ51-Ww","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/-RQeUQ6oWjA145ZrZ51-Ww.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9172353744506836},{"business_id":"5fCpIolPWznGdz3D6hjrvg","photo_id":"XEmw8Sq7JP5AxRsmLkmg7g","label":"food","image_url":